b_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982100/extras/9794684224f5334e03c5d991b2a7baee.poster.avif?t=1742813493\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982100/extras/9794684224f5334e03c5d991b2a7baee.webm?t=1742813493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982100/extras/9794684224f5334e03c5d991b2a7baee.mp4?t=1742813493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After touching the fish to fully-visible, remember to use the fishnet to get what you nurtured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982100/extras/e3d1228a2a06ed75bd854c564639980c.avif?t=1742813493\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fully-touched fish got by fishnet will swim freely in the viewing area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982100/extras/22c6fca6f482288d61a39c45e924da55.avif?t=1742813493\" data-has-big width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982100/extras/a29b6b6dc3fb713aadff526b02b5e9a1.poster.avif?t=1742813493\" width=800 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982100/extras/a29b6b6dc3fb713aadff526b02b5e9a1.webm?t=1742813493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982100/extras/a29b6b6dc3fb713aadff526b02b5e9a1.mp4?t=1742813493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are too busy at work don't have time to slack, you may hire our cute cat divers to nurture your cute fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982100/extras/168c660c4ee20f53e677b056b164d4cb.avif?t=1742813493\" width=242 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to freely explore more features in game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982100/extras/c2fa45082e1ddd549aa5fc484196f2df.avif?t=1742813493\" width=502 height=314 /></span></p>",
